{"Background": ("Illyana was born in Russia, the youngest sibling of Colossus (Piotr Rasputin). As a child, she was abducted by the sorcerer Belasco and taken to the demon realm known as Limbo. Although she was gone only briefly in Earth’s timeline, she spent years in Limbo, growing from a little girl into a teenager under Belasco’s corrupt tutelage. She eventually broke free by harnessing her latent mutant and mystical powers, forging her own Soulsword, and seizing control of Limbo’s twisted dimension. This tumultuous upbringing shaped her into a formidable warrior and sorceress.")}

{"Description": ("In recent story arcs, Illyana has been navigating her responsibilities as part of the X-Men and the New Mutants. She remains constantly torn between her bond with Limbo and her desire to find normalcy among her fellow mutants. While her demeanor can be aloof, her sharp wit and unwavering loyalty to her teammates have helped her form a tight-knit camaraderie. In daily life, she is driven by a sense of unspoken guilt over her demonic past, yet she masks her vulnerabilities with a cool exterior that belies the raging storms within.")}
